{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁוָה²","hw":"שְׁוָה²","html":"† II. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁוָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br><strong>Hithpa.</strong>  <strong> be set, made (</strong>Pa. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁוִּי</span> <em>make</em>, Cappadoc. Aramaic Lzb<sup>Eph. i. 67</sup>; cf. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁוָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁוָה²\", dir=\"rtl\">II.</a> [<a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁוָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁוָה²\", dir=\"rtl\">שָׁוָה</a>]<strong>)</strong>;—Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁתַּוִּ֑ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:29\" href=\"/Daniel.3.29\">Dn 3:29</a>, subj. rei + acc. <em>be made into</em> something (K<sup>§ 84, 3</sup>).","next":"BDB Aramaic, שׁוק","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁוָה"}